# Unzip the Claude Design "site bundle" output here.
#
# Expected contents after unzipping:
#   index.html              ← the marketing landing
#   asset_NNN.png|jpg|svg   ← images Claude Design baked in
#   asset_NNN.woff2         ← fonts (Inter + Fraunces variants)
#   asset_NNN.js            ← any inlined JS
#
# This directory is not part of the Vite build and is not synced to S3
# by the current deploy.sh. The cutover-day deploy script adds a step
# that copies these files into dist/ at the right paths.
#
# When you have the zip:
#   1. Save it at  docs/launch-assets/landing-page-v1/site.zip  (committed)
#   2. Unzip it here, into this directory.
#   3. Verify the file list matches expectations above.
